     Task 3: consumer-side integration (3-4日、2026-07-26→07-31)
     - kekkai/src の cjc test suite を quad-store.verify-chain に対して run
     - kototama/src の mesh node state validation を quad-store base に re-anchor
     - kotoba-client (browser) の commit verification を quad-store base に統一
     - regression test: drama access control path (kekkai guild authorization)

     Task 4: cold rebuild integration planning (2-3日、2026-08-01→08-03)
     - prolly-tree cold path (root CID → children index rebuild) を quad-store に統合
